                        Load Balancer
                             -------> ELB in AWS
                
--> Azure Load Balancer is a Layer 4 (TCP/UDP) load-balancing service that
distributes incoming network traffic across multiple backend resources, such as Azure Virtual Machines.
--> Its main purpose is to provide high availability, scalability, and 
better application performance by distributing traffic across healthy
backend servers.

**Types of Azure Load Balancer
Azure provides different load-balancing services for different requirements.

