1. Azure Load Balancer
--> Layer 4 (TCP/UDP).
--> Distributes network traffic.
--> Supports internal and external load balancing.
--> Suitable for VM-based applications.
 
2. Azure Application Gateway
--> Layer 7 (HTTP/HTTPS).
--> Supports URL-based routing.
--> Supports SSL termination.
--> Includes Web Application Firewall (WAF).